00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.000
what?

00:01:59.000 --> 00:01:59.600
A.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:00.200
Morning,

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:00.800
B.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:01.400
Night,

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.000
C.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:02.600
Sun,

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.800
or D.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:04.400
Light?

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.600
Five seconds!

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.600
TIME'S UP!

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:13.700
