00:04:03.233 --> 00:04:03.800
five,

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.367
seven,

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:05.533
then nine.

00:04:05.533 --> 00:04:09.033
So seventeen plus nine is twenty-six.

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:11.767
