00:04:45.033 --> 00:04:45.667
Two,

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:46.267
three,

00:04:46.267 --> 00:04:46.900
five,

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:47.533
eight,

00:04:47.533 --> 00:04:48.167
thirteen,

00:04:48.167 --> 00:04:49.433
and then...

00:04:49.433 --> 00:04:51.333
what comes next?

00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:51.967
A.

00:04:51.967 --> 00:04:52.600
Eighteen,

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.233
B.

00:04:53.233 --> 00:04:53.833
Twenty,

00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:54.467
C.

00:04:54.467 --> 00:04:55.100
Twenty-one,

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.367
