A triangle,

00:05:54.633 --> 00:05:55.200
B.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.300
A square,

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:56.867
C.

00:05:56.867 --> 00:05:58.000
A circle,

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.133
or D.

