Check this out,

00:06:24.167 --> 00:06:26.167
fill in the blank!

00:06:26.167 --> 00:06:29.167
The library was so quiet that

00:06:29.167 --> 00:06:31.633
even a whisper seemed blank,

00:06:31.633 --> 00:06:34.633
so everyone tried hard not to

00:06:34.633 --> 00:06:36.133
