00:06:36.133 --> 00:06:36.633
A.

00:06:36.633 --> 00:06:37.133
Heavy,

00:06:37.133 --> 00:06:37.633
B.

00:06:37.633 --> 00:06:38.133
Loud,

00:06:38.133 --> 00:06:38.633
C.

00:06:38.633 --> 00:06:39.133
Colorful,

00:06:39.133 --> 00:06:40.133
or D.

