Bottom-right,

00:07:07.167 --> 00:07:07.700
C.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:08.233
Center,

00:07:08.233 --> 00:07:09.300
or D.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:09.833
Bottom-left?

00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:10.900
Five seconds!

00:07:16.667 --> 00:07:17.867
TIME'S UP!

00:07:18.533 --> 00:07:20.067
The answer is...

00:07:20.067 --> 00:07:20.567
B,

00:07:20.567 --> 00:07:21.067
bottom-right!

00:07:21.067 --> 00:07:23.600
The dot steps clockwise corner

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:24.600
