00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:25.133
bottom-left,

00:07:25.133 --> 00:07:25.633
top-left,

00:07:25.633 --> 00:07:26.133
top-right,

00:07:26.133 --> 00:07:29.167
so the next corner is bottom-right.

00:07:30.333 --> 00:07:30.967
Alright,

00:07:30.967 --> 00:07:32.800
a number analogy!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.667
Two makes three,

00:07:34.667 --> 00:07:36.500
three makes five,

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.367
four makes seven,

00:07:38.367 --> 00:07:40.200
so five makes...

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:40.833
what?

00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:41.433
A.

00:07:41.433 --> 00:07:42.067
Eight,

00:07:42.067 --> 00:07:42.667
B.

00:07:42.667 --> 00:07:43.300
Ten,

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:43.900
C.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:44.533
Eleven,

00:07:44.533 --> 00:07:45.767
or D.

00:07:45.767 --> 00:07:46.367
Nine?

00:07:46.367 --> 00:07:47.600
Five seconds!

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.600
TIME'S UP!

00:07:55.267 --> 00:07:55.767
It's...

00:07:55.767 --> 00:07:56.300
D,

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:56.800
nine!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.867
Each number is doubled then take

00:07:59.867 --> 00:08:00.900
away one:

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:03.467
five times two is ten,

00:08:03.467 --> 00:08:05.500
minus one is nine.

00:08:06.667 --> 00:08:07.733
Here's one,

00:08:07.733 --> 00:08:09.300
a number puzzle,

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.900
and it's sneaky!

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:14.067
If two plus three makes ten,

00:08:14.067 --> 00:08:16.700
four plus one makes ten,

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.367
five plus two makes fourteen,

00:08:19.367 --> 00:08:22.000
then three plus four makes...

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:22.533
what?

00:08:22.533 --> 00:08:23.067
A.

00:08:23.067 --> 00:08:23.600
Seven,

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.100
B.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:24.633
Twelve,

00:08:24.633 --> 00:08:25.167
C.

00:08:25.167 --> 00:08:25.700
Fourteen,

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:26.767
or D.

00:08:26.767 --> 00:08:27.300
Twenty-four?

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.333
Five seconds!

00:08:34.133 --> 00:08:35.333
TIME'S UP!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.300
The answer is...

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:37.733
C,

00:08:37.733 --> 00:08:38.200
fourteen!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.800
The trick is to add the

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:41.667
two numbers,

00:08:41.667 --> 00:08:42.567
then double:

00:08:42.567 --> 00:08:44.733
three plus four is seven,

00:08:44.733 --> 00:08:47.367
and seven times two is fourteen.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:48.900
